{"id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-formula.md","title":"Terms, Formulas, Free Variables and Capture-Avoiding Substitution","display":"df-formula — Terms, Formulas, Free Variables and Capture-Avoiding Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-formula","aliases":["67-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — Terms, Formulas, Free Variables and Capture-Avoiding Substitution","depends_on":["[[67-df-syntax-interface]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — Terms, Formulas, Free Variables and Capture-Avoiding Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a> 的签名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。以下递归均按有限树或有限列的长度进行。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(a)\\)</span> 是项或公式中全部出现变量的集合，包括绑定变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_L\\)</span> 是自由变量集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VList}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{VList}(A)\\)</span> 对有限变量集按变量下标递增排列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 为变量到项的有限支撑替换：除有限多个变量外 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(x)=x\">\\(\\sigma(x)=x\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\setminus x\">\\(\\sigma\\setminus x\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>、其余不变。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_{x,z}\">\\(r_{x,z}\\)</span> 只把自由的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 改为新鲜变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，在遇到绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的量词时停止；它的递归式列在下方。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_L(a,\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_L(a,\\sigma)\\)</span> 记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a[\\sigma]\">\\(a[\\sigma]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a[\\vec t/\\vec x]\">\\(a[\\vec t/\\vec x]\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 各异，表示对应的同时替换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(t)\">\\(\\varphi(t)\\)</span> 的指定代入变量必须在使用该记号的 Hypothesis 中声明。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 遍历有限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{|\\vec x|}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{|\\vec x|}\\)</span>；同时替换限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,m)\\)</span> 在下式递归选取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个新鲜变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 遍历公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 遍历项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 是空列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\vec x\">\\(\\exists\\vec x\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\\vec\\varphi\">\\(\\bigwedge\\vec\\varphi\\)</span> 均为下列递归构造，不依赖隐含括号约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\\\nT_{m+1}&amp;\\coloneqq T_m\\cup\\{f(\\vec t):f\\in F_L\\land\\vec t\\in T_m^{a_L(f)}\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Term}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_mT_m,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Atom}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t=u:t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\}\\cup\\{R(\\vec t):R\\in R_L\\land\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{a_L(R)}\\},\\\\\nX_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Atom}_L,\\\\\nX_{m+1}&amp;\\coloneqq X_m\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in X_m\\}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in X_m\\}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\land\\varphi\\in X_m\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_mX_m.\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_L(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\\mathrm{free}_L(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{free}_L(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_L(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(t)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_L(u),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}_L(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{free}_L(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_L(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_L(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_L(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\\operatorname{var}(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(u),&amp;\\operatorname{var}(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi),&amp;\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{fresh}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin A\\}},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\vec x|\\ (x_i\\ne x_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,m+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,m){}^\\frown\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{fresh}\\!\\bigl(A\\cup\\{(\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,m))_i:i&lt;m\\}\\bigr)\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Subst}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{\\mathrm{Var}_L}:\n\\bigl|\\{x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L:\\sigma(x)\\ne x\\}\\bigr|&lt;\\aleph_0\\right\\},\\\\\n(\\sigma\\setminus x)(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\sigma(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_L),\\\\\n\\sigma_{\\vec x,\\vec t}(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nt_{\\iota i&lt;|\\vec x|\\ (x_i=y)},&amp;y\\in\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\},\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\notin\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_L[x_0,\\ldots,x_{m-1}]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_L[\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{m-1}\\rangle],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_L[\\vec x]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{VList}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec x\\bigl[\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)\\land\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\}=A\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\vec x|\\ \\operatorname{ind}(x_i)&lt;\\operatorname{ind}(x_j)\\bigr],&amp;\\operatorname{ind}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq i.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\\\\nT_{m+1}&amp;\\coloneqq T_m\\cup\\{f(\\vec t):f\\in F_L\\land\\vec t\\in T_m^{a_L(f)}\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Term}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_mT_m,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Atom}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t=u:t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\}\\cup\\{R(\\vec t):R\\in R_L\\land\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{a_L(R)}\\},\\\\\nX_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Atom}_L,\\\\\nX_{m+1}&amp;\\coloneqq X_m\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in X_m\\}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in X_m\\}\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\land\\varphi\\in X_m\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_mX_m.\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_L(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\\mathrm{free}_L(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{free}_L(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_L(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(t)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_L(u),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}_L(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{free}_L(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_L(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_L(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_L(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\\operatorname{var}(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(u),&amp;\\operatorname{var}(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi),&amp;\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{fresh}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin A\\}},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\vec x|\\ (x_i\\ne x_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,m+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,m){}^\\frown\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{fresh}\\!\\bigl(A\\cup\\{(\\operatorname{FreshSeq}_L(A,m))_i:i&lt;m\\}\\bigr)\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Subst}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^{\\mathrm{Var}_L}:\n\\bigl|\\{x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L:\\sigma(x)\\ne x\\}\\bigr|&lt;\\aleph_0\\right\\},\\\\\n(\\sigma\\setminus x)(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\sigma(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_L),\\\\\n\\sigma_{\\vec x,\\vec t}(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nt_{\\iota i&lt;|\\vec x|\\ (x_i=y)},&amp;y\\in\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\},\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\notin\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\},\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_L[x_0,\\ldots,x_{m-1}]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_L[\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{m-1}\\rangle],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_L[\\vec x]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{VList}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec x\\bigl[\\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x)\\land\\{x_i:i&lt;|\\vec x|\\}=A\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|\\vec x|\\ \\operatorname{ind}(x_i)&lt;\\operatorname{ind}(x_j)\\bigr],&amp;\\operatorname{ind}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq i.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}_L(a,\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq a[\\sigma]\n\\quad(a\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_L),\\\\\na[\\vec t/\\vec x]&amp;\\coloneqq a[\\sigma_{\\vec x,\\vec t}],\\\\\nr_{x,z}(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}z,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}&amp;\nr_{x,z}(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq f((r_{x,z}(t_i))_i),\\\\\nr_{x,z}(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq(r_{x,z}(t)=r_{x,z}(u)),&amp;\nr_{x,z}(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq R((r_{x,z}(t_i))_i),\\\\\nr_{x,z}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg r_{x,z}(\\varphi),&amp;\nr_{x,z}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq r_{x,z}(\\varphi)\\land r_{x,z}(\\psi),\\\\\nr_{x,z}(\\forall y\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall y\\varphi,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\forall y\\,r_{x,z}(\\varphi),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\nx[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma(x),&amp;f(\\vec t)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq f((t_i[\\sigma])_i),\\\\\n(t=u)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq(t[\\sigma]=u[\\sigma]),&amp;R(\\vec t)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq R((t_i[\\sigma])_i),\\\\\n(\\neg\\varphi)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi[\\sigma]),&amp;\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi[\\sigma]\\land\\psi[\\sigma],\\\\\nB_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{y\\in\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}}\\mathrm{free}_L(\\sigma(y)),\\\\\nz_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi)\\cup B_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma}\\cup\\{x\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\varphi)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall x(\\varphi[\\sigma\\setminus x]),&amp;x\\notin B_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma},\\\\\n\\forall z\\bigl(r_{x,z}(\\varphi)[\\sigma\\setminus x\\setminus z]\\bigr),&amp;x\\in B_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma},\\ z=z_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}_L(a,\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq a[\\sigma]\n\\quad(a\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_L),\\\\\na[\\vec t/\\vec x]&amp;\\coloneqq a[\\sigma_{\\vec x,\\vec t}],\\\\\nr_{x,z}(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}z,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}&amp;\nr_{x,z}(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq f((r_{x,z}(t_i))_i),\\\\\nr_{x,z}(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq(r_{x,z}(t)=r_{x,z}(u)),&amp;\nr_{x,z}(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq R((r_{x,z}(t_i))_i),\\\\\nr_{x,z}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg r_{x,z}(\\varphi),&amp;\nr_{x,z}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq r_{x,z}(\\varphi)\\land r_{x,z}(\\psi),\\\\\nr_{x,z}(\\forall y\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall y\\varphi,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\forall y\\,r_{x,z}(\\varphi),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\nx[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma(x),&amp;f(\\vec t)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq f((t_i[\\sigma])_i),\\\\\n(t=u)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq(t[\\sigma]=u[\\sigma]),&amp;R(\\vec t)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq R((t_i[\\sigma])_i),\\\\\n(\\neg\\varphi)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi[\\sigma]),&amp;\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi[\\sigma]\\land\\psi[\\sigma],\\\\\nB_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{y\\in\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}}\\mathrm{free}_L(\\sigma(y)),\\\\\nz_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi)\\cup B_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma}\\cup\\{x\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\varphi)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall x(\\varphi[\\sigma\\setminus x]),&amp;x\\notin B_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma},\\\\\n\\forall z\\bigl(r_{x,z}(\\varphi)[\\sigma\\setminus x\\setminus z]\\bigr),&amp;x\\in B_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma},\\ z=z_{x,\\varphi,\\sigma}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi\\lor\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),&amp;\n\\varphi\\to\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi),&amp;\n\\exists x\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi,\\\\\n\\top_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0),&amp;\\bot_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\top_L,\\\\\n\\forall\\epsilon\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,&amp;\\forall(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(\\forall\\vec y\\,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\exists\\epsilon\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,&amp;\\exists(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x(\\exists\\vec y\\,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\epsilon&amp;\\coloneqq\\top_L,&amp;\\bigwedge(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle{}^\\frown s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi\\land\\bigwedge s,\\\\\n\\bigvee\\epsilon&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_L,&amp;\\bigvee(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle{}^\\frown s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi\\lor\\bigvee s,\\\\\n\\exists!x\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\bigl(\\varphi\\land\\forall z(\\varphi[z/x]\\to z=x)\\bigr)\\quad(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_L(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall\\operatorname{VList}(\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi))\\,\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi\\lor\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),&amp;\n\\varphi\\to\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi),&amp;\n\\exists x\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi,\\\\\n\\top_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0),&amp;\\bot_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\top_L,\\\\\n\\forall\\epsilon\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,&amp;\\forall(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(\\forall\\vec y\\,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\exists\\epsilon\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,&amp;\\exists(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x(\\exists\\vec y\\,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\epsilon&amp;\\coloneqq\\top_L,&amp;\\bigwedge(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle{}^\\frown s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi\\land\\bigwedge s,\\\\\n\\bigvee\\epsilon&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_L,&amp;\\bigvee(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle{}^\\frown s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi\\lor\\bigvee s,\\\\\n\\exists!x\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\bigl(\\varphi\\land\\forall z(\\varphi[z/x]\\to z=x)\\bigr)\\quad(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{var}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_L(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall\\operatorname{VList}(\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi))\\,\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>公式等号指有限树相等，逻辑等价另用可推导性或满足关系表达。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 只用于已经具有唯一值的有序有限列构造。自由变量改名与替换都已给出递归规则，不再依赖外册的第 88/90 册语法接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[67-df-syntax-interface]] 的签名。$x,y,z$ 遍历 $\\mathrm{Var}_L$；$i,j,m\\in\\mathbb N$。以下递归均按有限树或有限列的长度进行。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_L","d